{"agent":"bugfix5","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The test’s name and docstring promise the B42016bbc0e case: a contended lease whose unit_tests run is only queued (#k on the full-suite lock), not started, must not be yield-requested. The body never queues anything. It calls `RUN.mark_started(repo, \"T1\", \"unit_tests\", sha=\"abc\")` and then `heartbeat T1`, so it only covers an already-started run whose pid is this process. A regression that still treats a lock-queued, not-yet-started gate as idle (the case the intent says must not be broken or yield-requested) leaves this assertion green.","digest":"ad2b1bd6b1d6aa7a","location":"tests/test_lease_progress_breakable.py:test_a_gate_queued_on_the_suite_lock_is_not_yield_requested","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_lease_progress_breakable.py:test_a_gate_queued_on_the_suite_lock_is_not_yield_requested"}],"chunks_total":1,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":2170,"diff_sha":"9dddd8077f37889d58a9aca2ed41cc76c48f6a9082f469830c9a1f173a5bd056","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":35.3,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"4a52c71880069dec","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B42016bbc0e.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261105T215132Z-47831531.jsonl","reason":"","review_id":"94d52cb684e9","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"82dc8bcf02de145d350b2b58b4d2c73d67221b7a","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/lifecycle/heartbeat.py":"100644 e1f812d1db28c2fcf1e4b0a0bf6fe48ae5db694c","tests/test_lease_progress_breakable.py":"100644 23215973e5ea4f1a12107fa589c306a8358d3d0b"},"reviewer":"grok-4.7","reviewer_digest":"1857ec352c55ee94","reviewer_families":["xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["tests/test_lease_progress_breakable