{"agent":"bugfix5","data":{"digest":"ad2b1bd6b1d6aa7a","finding":1,"gate":"rubber_duck","location":"tests/test_lease_progress_breakable.py:test_a_gate_queued_on_the_suite_lock_is_not_yield_requested","probe":"the queued gate carries the SAME .running.<pid>.json marker: gate run writes it (ddflow/api/gates/_run.py:339 _mark_or_refuse_twin -> RUN.claim_started) BEFORE run_command_gate -> _run_holding_the_suite_lock -> suitelock.SL.hold, and the process stays alive while queued; RUN.live_runs (what _live_gate reads) sees a queued gate exactly as mark_started's marker. There is no 'queued but unmarked' state. Test renamed to test_an_inflight_gate_run_is_not_yield_requested_by_the_heartbeat with the equivalence documented","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_lease_progress_breakable.py:test_a_gate_queued_on_the_suite_lock_is_not_yield_requested","verdict":"refuted"},"id":"e39c4adcc385e3725df8a38e9","kind":"review.triaged","lamport":143498,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B42016bbc0e","ts":"2026-11-05T21:54:40.836434Z"}
